{
  "name": "Handle WhatsApp Voice, Image, and Text Support Inquiries with OpenAI, Google Sheets CRM, and Supergreen",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "f5050005-5555-4555-8555-000000000001",
      "name": "Workflow Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -600,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 920,
        "content": "## Multimodal WhatsApp AI Support & Lead CRM (Voice, Image & Text)\n\n### Who this is for\nE-commerce brands, clinics, and B2B service teams handling inbound WhatsApp inquiries where customers frequently send **voice notes** or **photos/screenshots** alongside text — without Meta Cloud API template locks.\n\n### What problem it solves\nText-only WhatsApp bots break as soon as a customer sends a voice message or a photo of a damaged item/error screen. This workflow handles all three modalities end-to-end, logs structured leads & tickets to Google Sheets, and escalates urgent cases to your team's WhatsApp group:\n1. **Inbound Multimodal Router:** Receives real-time messages via **Supergreen Trigger** (`onlyIncoming: true`), ignores `@g.us` group chatter, displays a WhatsApp typing indicator, and inspects `attachments` to route **Audio/Voice Notes**, **Images**, or **Plain Text**.\n2. **Voice & Vision Pre-Processing:** Downloads voice notes from the signed attachment URL and transcribes them with **OpenAI Whisper**; analyzes customer images/screenshots with **OpenAI Vision (`gpt-4o-mini`)**; merges everything into a unified customer prompt.\n3. **AI Support & Lead Triage Agent:** Uses **OpenAI (`gpt-4o-mini`)** + **Window Buffer Memory** (per `chat.id`) + **Structured Output Parser** to produce a concise WhatsApp reply plus structured classification (`category`: `faq | sales_lead | human_escalation`, `summary`, `priority`).\n4. **CRM Logging & Human Handoff:** Replies on WhatsApp quoting the customer's message, appends `sales_lead` and `human_escalation` rows to **Google Sheets**, and alerts your internal staff WhatsApp group when human intervention is needed.\n\n### Community Node & Compatibility\n- **Community node:** `n8n-nodes-supergreen` (tested `v0.1.5` on n8n `v1.76+`) — **verified community node** available directly on **n8n Cloud** and self-hosted n8n (`https://www.npmjs.com/package/n8n-nodes-supergreen`).\n\n### Setup steps\n1. Connect **Supergreen API** (`https://supergreen.cc`), **OpenAI API**, and **Google Sheets OAuth2** credentials.\n2. Create a Google Sheet tab named `Inquiries` with columns: `timestamp`, `phone`, `senderName`, `modality`, `category`, `priority`, `summary`, `customerInput`.\n3. Update **Configure Support Settings** with your `businessName`, `knowledgeBase`, `spreadsheetId`, and `escalationGroupChatId` (`YOUR_TEAM_GROUP_ID@g.us`).\n4. Activate the workflow."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f5050005-5555-4555-8555-000000000002",
      "name": "Modality Sticky",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1180,
        "height": 540,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## 1. Inbound Trigger, Modality Detection & Voice/Vision Extraction\n\nFilters direct customer chats, shows a native WhatsApp typing indicator, and routes audio voice notes to OpenAI Whisper or images to OpenAI Vision before unifying the message text."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f5050005-5555-4555-8555-000000000003",
      "name": "Agent Sticky",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1180,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1240,
        "height": 580,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## 2. Structured AI Triage, Quoted WhatsApp Reply, Google Sheets CRM & Team Escalation\n\nGenerates a conversational reply + structured triage JSON, replies to the customer on WhatsApp, logs leads/escalations to Google Sheets, and notifies the team WhatsApp group for urgent handoffs."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f5050005-5555-4555-8555-000000000010",
      "name": "When Customer Message Arrives",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-supergreen.supergreenTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        260
      ],
      "webhookId": "f5050005-5555-4555-8555-100000000010",
      "credentials": {
        "supergreenApi": {
          "id": "supergreen-cred",
          "name": "Supergreen API"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "network": "whatsapp",
        "events": [
          "message"
        ],
        "onlyIncoming": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f5050005-5555-4555-8555-000000000011",
      "name": "Configure Support Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "s1",
              "name": "businessName",
              "value": "Northstar Gear",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "s2",
              "name": "knowledgeBase",
              "value": "Support hours: Mon-Fri 9am-6pm UTC. Free shipping on orders over $75. 30-day returns on unused items. Wholesale inquiries (10+ units) qualify for 20% off.",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "s3",
              "name": "spreadsheetId",
              "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "s4",
              "name": "escalationGroupChatId",
              "value": "YOUR_TEAM_GROUP_ID@g.us",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f5050005-5555-4555-8555-000000000012",
      "name": "Detect Modality and Filter Direct Chats",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const ev = $('When Customer Message Arrives').first().json;\nconst cfg = $('Configure Support Settings').first().json;\nconst chatId = String(ev.chat?.id || '');\nif (!chatId || chatId.endsWith('@g.us')) return [];\n\nconst attachments = Array.isArray(ev.attachments) ? ev.attachments : [];\nconst firstAtt = attachments[0] || null;\nconst mime = String(firstAtt?.mimeType || '').toLowerCase();\nconst fileUri = String(firstAtt?.fileUri || '');\nconst text = String(ev.text || firstAtt?.caption || '').trim();\n\nlet modality = 'text';\nif (fileUri && mime.startsWith('audio/')) modality = 'audio';\nelse if (fileUri && mime.startsWith('image/')) modality = 'image';\n\nif (modality === 'text' && !text) return [];\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    chatId,\n    cleanPhone: chatId.replace(/@.*$/, ''),\n    senderName: String(ev.author?.username || ev.chat?.title || chatId.replace(/@.*$/, '')),\n    messageId: String(ev.messageId || ''),\n    modality,\n    text,\n    fileUri,\n    mimeType: mime,\n    businessName: cfg.businessName,\n    knowledgeBase: cfg.knowledgeBase,\n    spreadsheetId: cfg.spreadsheetId,\n    escalationGroupChatId: cfg.escalationGroupChatId,\n  },\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f5050005-5555-4555-8555-000000000013",
      "name": "Show WhatsApp Typing Indicator",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-supergreen.supergreen",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        260
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "supergreenApi": {
          "id": "supergreen-cred",
          "name": "Supergreen API"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "sendTyping",
        "toNumber": "={{ $json.chatId }}",
        "duration": 5000
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f5050005-5555-4555-8555-000000000014",
      "name": "Route by Message Modality",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "mod-audio",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $('Detect Modality and Filter Direct Chats').item.json.modality }}",
                    "rightValue": "audio",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Voice Note"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "mod-image",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $('Detect Modality and Filter Direct Chats').item.json.modality }}",
                    "rightValue": "image",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Image"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "mod-text",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $('Detect Modality and Filter Direct Chats').item.json.modality }}",
                    "rightValue": "text",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Text"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f5050005-5555-4555-8555-000000000015",
      "name": "Download Voice Note Audio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $('Detect Modality and Filter Direct Chats').item.json.fileUri }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file",
              "outputPropertyName": "data"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f5050005-5555-4555-8555-000000000016",
      "name": "Transcribe Voice Note with Whisper",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.8,
      "position": [
        1300,
        120
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "openai-cred",
          "name": "OpenAI API"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "audio",
        "operation": "transcribe",
        "binaryPropertyName": "data",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f5050005-5555-4555-8555-000000000017",
      "name": "Analyze Customer Image with Vision",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.8,
      "position": [
        1200,
        260
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "openai-cred",
          "name": "OpenAI API"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "image",
        "operation": "analyze",
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "text": "=Describe what the customer is showing in this image (product issue, receipt, order number, or screenshot) so support can assist them. Customer caption: {{ $('Detect Modality and Filter Direct Chats').item.json.text || 'none' }}",
        "inputType": "url",
        "imageUrls": "={{ $('Detect Modality and Filter Direct Chats').item.json.fileUri }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f5050005-5555-4555-8555-000000000018",
      "name": "Build Unified Customer Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1500,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const meta = $('Detect Modality and Filter Direct Chats').first().json;\nconst current = $input.first().json;\nlet normalizedInput = meta.text;\nif (meta.modality === 'audio') {\n  normalizedInput = `[Voice note transcript]: ${current.text || ''}`;\n} else if (meta.modality === 'image') {\n  const visionText = current.content || current.text || JSON.stringify(current);\n  normalizedInput = `[Customer sent an image. Caption: \"${meta.text || 'none'}\". Visual analysis: ${visionText}]`;\n}\nreturn [{ json: { ...meta, normalizedInput } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f5050005-5555-4555-8555-000000000019",
      "name": "Support and Triage AI Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        1720,
        260
      ],
      "hasOutputParser": true,
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.normalizedInput }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are the WhatsApp support & sales assistant for {{ $json.businessName }}.\nKnowledge base: {{ $json.knowledgeBase }}\n\nRespond with helpful, concise WhatsApp-friendly answers (under 90 words).\nClassify every message into one category:\n- \"faq\": standard question answered from the knowledge base\n- \"sales_lead\": wholesale, bulk order, pricing quote, or partnership inquiry\n- \"human_escalation\": damaged item photo, refund dispute, angry customer, or explicit request for a human agent."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f5050005-5555-4555-8555-000000000020",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1660,
        460
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "openai-cred",
          "name": "OpenAI API"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f5050005-5555-4555-8555-000000000021",
      "name": "Per-Customer Chat Memory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1800,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $('Build Unified Customer Prompt').item.json.chatId }}",
        "contextWindowLength": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f5050005-5555-4555-8555-000000000022",
      "name": "Structured Triage Output Parser",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1940,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\"reply\":\"Thanks for sending that over! Here is how we can help...\",\"category\":\"sales_lead\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"summary\":\"Customer asked for wholesale pricing on 25 units.\"}"
      }
    },
    {
